Enhancement: Add a pre-test-command input to the PHP Unit workflow

Apps whose unit tests talk to external services had no way to start them, so
they could not use the reusable PHP Unit workflow. files_antivirus needs a
dummy clamd and an ICAP ClamAV server, which Drone used to provide, and its
unit tests stopped running in CI when Drone was shut down. The new
pre-test-command input runs a shell command in the app directory after the app
is enabled and before PHPUnit.

